This product includes adapted Apache-2.0 implementation patterns from the
following projects. The local implementation remains subject to this product's
license; the upstream projects retain their own copyrights and licenses.

Apache Iceberg
https://github.com/apache/iceberg
The compositional Parquet value-writer/value-reader and local-file I/O patterns
were used as design precedents for the Arrow-indexed writer and reader plans.

Apache parquet-java
https://github.com/apache/parquet-java
The ParquetFileWriter, MessageColumnIO, page-store, and direct InputFile /
OutputFile lifecycle surfaces are used through the parquet-java 1.17.1 API and
informed the corresponding adapters.

Apache Arrow Java
https://github.com/apache/arrow-java
The ArrowReader lifecycle and Arrow IPC schema metadata codec patterns are used
against Arrow Java 19.0.0.
